Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

The technical plan specifies CC BY 4.0 (matching the data source's licence). The full legal text is at
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode - replace this notice with that text before publishing.
Note: CC licences are designed for content/data rather than software; consider a software licence (e.g. MIT or
Apache-2.0) for the code and keep CC BY 4.0 for documentation and derived data.
